                                                "sense_id": "f2c61820-a504-363b-91b4-9b34fea8accb",
                                                "text": "Apparently it never occurs to them that you can't make rapid, drastic changes in the technology and the economy of a society without causing rapid changes in all other aspects of the society as well, […]"
